  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It is still a matter of wonder how they kill so swiftly and so silently.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 6.2
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A chamber of heat, and a mirror to throw it in a parallel beam.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 8.375,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Whatever will burn burns at its touch.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 13.917,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "That night forty people lay about the pit, and the common burned till morning.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 18.167,
      "seconds": 6.2
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "In Woking the shops had shut when it happened.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 26.5,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbours_wife",
      "text": "Half Woking's out on the common already. Come on.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 31.792,
      "seconds": 3.62
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Few of them even knew the cylinder had opened.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 36.542,
      "seconds": 3.59
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They found knots of people already there, watching the mirror turn.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 41.25,
      "seconds": 4.76
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "By half past eight there were three hundred of them.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 47.75,
      "seconds": 3.11
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Three policemen, with Stent's instructions: keep them back.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 52.0,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "And booing, from the sort to whom a crowd is an occasion for noise.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 57.625,
      "seconds": 4.53
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "stent",
      "text": "Nine is two hours. They are out there now.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 63.292,
      "seconds": 3.46
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "Then we go out to them ourselves.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 67.875,
      "seconds": 3.31
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They had wired the barracks. Soldiers by nine, and it was half past eight.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 72.292,
      "seconds": 5.14
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then they went back to lead the advance themselves.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 79.333,
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Three puffs of green smoke. A humming note. The flashes of flame.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 84.458,
      "seconds": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "That crowd had a far narrower escape than mine.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 93.333,
      "seconds": 3.61
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A hummock of heathery sand took the lower part of the ray.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 98.875,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A few yards higher, and none of them could have lived to tell it.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 104.375,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The beam swung over their heads and lit the tops of the beeches.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 109.417,
      "seconds": 4.12
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It split the bricks, brought down a gable, and the road began to burn.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 118.25,
      "seconds": 4.62
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbours_wife",
      "text": "The trees have caught. The whole road's alight.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 125.0,
      "seconds": 3.45
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The mounted man could do nothing but turn and go with them.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 131.667,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Where the road grows narrow between the banks, the crowd jammed.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 139.167,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Three at least did not get out. Two women, and a little boy.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 146.125,
      "seconds": 5.32
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Crushed and trampled in the dark, between banks too steep to climb.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 153.75,
      "seconds": 4.89
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A boot went under, and a hat, and neither came up again.",
      "shot": 27,
      "at": 161.167,
      "seconds": 3.61
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbours_wife",
      "text": "They're coming!",
      "shot": 28,
      "at": 167.792,
      "seconds": 1.49
    }
  ]
}